    "prompt_blocks":  {
                          "sergio_black_base":  "Vertical realistic phone-camera video, Sergio as a founder/operator and practical consultant, wearing a clean all-black outfit: black t-shirt, black pants, dark shoes, no visible logos, natural confident posture, direct eye contact, authentic working environment, subtle handheld movement, realistic lighting, modern Latin American business context, serious but approachable tone.",
                          "sergio_avatar_master":  "Create a realistic vertical 9:16 talking-avatar / UGC creator video of Sergio for ONIA. Use Sergio\u0027s approved private reference pack to preserve identity consistently across shots: same face structure, short dark hair, natural expression, direct eye contact, slim young founder/operator presence. Outfit: all-black, clean, simple, no visible logos. The video must feel like a real phone-camera creator clip, not a glossy stock ad. Use natural Spanish delivery, small pauses, subtle hand movement, believable breathing, readable captions, and visual change every 2-3 seconds. Structure: hook, context, mechanism, proof of process, CTA. Use fictional/safe screens only.",
                          "onia_base":  "Vertical business content video for ONIA, practical AI automation and sales operations consultancy, clean real workspace, WhatsApp leads, CRM board, n8n workflow and Notion dashboard shown only with fictional/safe data, consultant-led explanation, modern but realistic production, clear business problem, human sales handoff, no exaggerated claims.",
                          "client_ugc_base":  "Vertical UGC-style sales video for a real client product or service, natural creator energy, realistic location related to the business, clear problem in the first 2 seconds, simple demonstration, believable benefit, conversational tone, no fake testimonial, no guaranteed result, no unapproved brand logos.",
                          "negative_safe":  "No fake celebrity, no copying a real creator identity, no unapproved logos, no confidential screens, no visible private phone numbers, no fake income claims, no guaranteed results, no medical/legal/financial promises, no exaggerated testimonial, no deepfake publication, no voice clone unless approved.",
                          "sergio_avatar_negative":  "No celebrity likeness, no copied creator identity, no changing Sergio\u0027s identity, no older-age transformation, no sexualized styling, no logos unless provided, no private screens, no real phone numbers, no fake client results, no fake revenue claims, no exaggerated guru gestures, no distorted face, no extra fingers, no broken lip-sync, no voice clone or publication unless explicitly approved."
